    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠣᠪᠣᠷᠭᠠᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>suburγalaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>сувраалах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SUBURΓALA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. and t. To rise or appear like a stupa, rise in a straight line to considerable hight (smoke or trees); to construct a stupa; to enshrine the ashes of a high lama or dignitary in a stupa.</definition>
      <page>734</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠱᠠᠷᠢᠯ ᠢ ᠰᠤᠪᠤᠷᠭᠠᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>šaril i --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To enshrine relics in a stupa.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
